for the queue-splitting patch I sketched: if batch contains > 15% long requests (len > 512), split them into a dedicated long-request batch and process separately. Pseudocode:
```
func maybeSplitBatch(batch):
  longReqs = filter(batch, req.seqLen > 512)
  if len(longReqs)/len(batch) > 0.15:
    return [batch - longReqs, longReqs]
  return [batch]
```
