Implementation sketch for TS: default Session class in Node. Browser version throws if you call `Session.persist()` to avoid accidental leaks. Example:
```ts
const session = await client.startSession({ model:'x' });
for await (const chunk of session.stream()) { /*...*/ }
// session.autoRenew = true by default in Node
```

